WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS

The network as built here, the case and oneline files, the sweep design, the
measured margins, the figures and the written analysis.

WHAT IT DOES NOT COVER

The WSCC 9 bus system itself, also known as the Anderson and Fouad three
machine nine bus system, which has been published and reproduced throughout
the power systems literature for decades and is not claimed here. Only the
files built here and everything derived from them are covered above.

